# Obsidian Setup ⚙️

## Core Plugins ➕

- **Daily notes** - Essential for journaling and tracking daily tasks.
- **Backlinks** - Vital for connecting notes and understanding relationships.
- **Outgoing Links** - Helps discover connections between notes.
- **Tag Pane** - Quick access to tags.
- **Search** - Obviously... 🔍
- **File Recovery** - Just in case! 💾
- **Quickswitch** - Quickly switch between vaults.
- **Open Link with Editor** - Opens links in the editor.

## Useful Plugins ✨

- **Breadcrumbs** - Visualize note hierarchy. 🗺️
- **Dataview** - Query and display data from your notes. 📊
- **Templater** - Automate note creation. 🤖
- **QuickAdd** - Capture information quickly. ✍️
- **Calendar** - View notes by date. 🗓️
- **Periodic Notes** - Recurring notes (daily, weekly, monthly). 🔁
- **Note Refactor** - Rename and reorganize notes.
- **Table Editor** - Easier table editing. 🔭
- **Excalidraw** - Drawing and diagramming. ✏️

## Appearance 🎨

- **Minimal Theme** - Clean and uncluttered.
- **Better Font Handling** - Improved font rendering.
- **Smooth Scrolling** - More pleasant scrolling experience.

## Custom CSS 💅

css
/* Example CSS */
body {
  font-family: sans-serif;
}


## Keyboard Shortcuts ⌨️

- `Ctrl/Cmd + P` - Quick search.
- `Ctrl/Cmd + Shift + P` - Open command palette.
- `Ctrl/Cmd + E` - Open the second pane.
- `Ctrl/Cmd + B` - Toggle bold.